# A recipe's render (tools/make_manual.py --renders): from P5, headphones, Pitch lock off, Scene time 0.
# "# @" marks the listening times (tools/make_manual.py --times).
notips
phones 1
set 74 0
set 71 0
tapkey w4
tap PLAY
wait 2500
wav sync.wav
# @ P5 Abyss as it starts: dark, closed filters
wait 1500
# @ hard sync on, drone II up above drone I, its filter opened and brought forward: a hard, buzzy edge
tapkey b9
tap HOME
turn K3 15 60
tap HOME
turn K4 30 60
turn K3 20 60
turn K1 -20 60
wait 1500
shot sync-0.png
tap LFO
# @ the LFO sweeps drone II's pitch: under the sync it's heard as a tearing, vocal sweep of tone
turn K3 70 30
turn SELECT 25 60
wait 500
shot sync-1.png
wait 12000
wavstop
